// About copy for the home page. One string per paragraph, written as markdown.
[
  {
    "id": "home",
    "body": [
      "We are a small collective of four omni-hobbyists: Bryan, Dave, Dan, and Scott, who enjoy building software for an audience of one: **ourselves**. We're veterans of the Internet, having seen how design and development have evolved over the past 25 years: from Web Standards to... whatever you call the current age.",
      "The software we make may seem all over the place when it comes to the needs we cover, but we will always believe that building great software starts with fulfilling your own needs first.",
    ],
  },
]
